---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Header from '../components/Header.astro';
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro';

const repo = 'https://github.com/pamu512/tarka';
const sandboxGuide = `${repo}/blob/master/docs/docs/guides/sandbox-five-minute.md`;
const codespaces = `https://github.com/codespaces/new?hide_repo_select=true&ref=master&repo=pamu512%2Ftarka`;
---

<Layout
	title="Get started — Tarka"
	description="Install Tarka with the Python CLI, Docker Compose lite stack, or GitHub Codespaces. Links to the five-minute sandbox guide."
>
	<div class="page">
		<Header />
		<main>
			<h1>Get started</h1>
			<p class="intro">
				Everything below lives in the{' '}
				<a href={repo}>canonical repository</a>. For copy-paste ports, curls, and UI paths, use the{' '}
				<a href={sandboxGuide}>five-minute sandbox guide</a>.
			</p>

			<section>
				<h2>1. Installer (Python 3.11+)</h2>
				<pre><code>git clone https://github.com/pamu512/tarka.git
cd tarka
python tarka.py install --lite</code></pre>
				<p>
					Use <code>python tarka.py install</code> for an interactive module pick, or <code>--all</code> for
					the full stack.
				</p>
			</section>

			<section>
				<h2>2. Docker Compose (lite)</h2>
				<pre><code>git clone https://github.com/pamu512/tarka.git
cd tarka
docker compose -f deploy/docker-compose.lite.yml up -d --build</code></pre>
				<p>Typical local ports: frontend <code>3000</code>, decision API <code>8000</code>, integration ingress <code>8003</code>.</p>
			</section>

			<section>
				<h2>3. Prebuilt sandbox image (optional)</h2>
				<pre><code>docker compose -f https://raw.githubusercontent.com/pamu512/tarka/master/deploy/docker-compose.sandbox.yml up -d</code></pre>
			</section>

			<section>
				<h2>4. GitHub Codespaces</h2>
				<p>
					Open a cloud dev environment from the repo, then run the same Compose command.{' '}
					<a href={codespaces}>Create a Codespace</a>
					— ports <code>3000</code>, <code>8000</code>, <code>8002</code>, <code>8003</code> are forwarded per
					the devcontainer.
				</p>
			</section>
		</main>
		<Footer />
	</div>
</Layout>

<style>
	.page {
		min-height: 100vh;
		display: flex;
		flex-direction: column;
	}

	main {
		flex: 1;
		max-width: 720px;
		margin: 0 auto;
		padding: 2rem 1.25rem 4rem;
		width: 100%;
	}

	h1 {
		font-size: clamp(1.75rem, 4vw, 2.25rem);
		margin: 0 0 1rem;
	}

	.intro {
		font-size: 1.05rem;
		color: var(--text-muted);
		margin: 0 0 2rem;
	}

	section {
		margin-bottom: 2rem;
	}

	h2 {
		font-size: 1.1rem;
		margin: 0 0 0.65rem;
	}

	section p {
		color: var(--text-muted);
		font-size: 0.95rem;
		margin: 0.75rem 0 0;
	}
</style>
